[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Do You Speak English?]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.47]Did the young man speak English? | 那个青年人会讲英语吗？
[00:15.27]I had an amusing experience last year. | 去年我有过一次有趣的经历。
[00:19.24]After I had left a small village in the south of France, | 在离开法国南部的一个小村庄后，
[00:23.47]I drove on to the next town. | 我继续驶往下一个城镇。
[00:26.82]On the way, a young man waved to me. | 途中，一个青年人向我招手。
[00:30.58]I stopped and he asked me for a lift. | 我停下车，他请求搭车。
[00:34.62]As soon as he had got into the car, | 他一上车，
[00:37.90]I said good morning to him in French and he replied in the same language. | 我就用法语向他问早上好，他也用法语作了回答。
[00:44.36]Apart from a few words, | 除了个别几个单词外，
[00:46.65]I do not know any French at all. | 我根本不会法语。
[00:50.17]Neither of us spoke during the journey. | 旅途中我们谁也没讲话。
[00:53.32]I had nearly reached the town, when the young man suddenly said, very slowly, | 就在快到镇子时，那青年突然非常慢地说道：
[01:00.63]'Do you speak English?' | “你会讲英语吗？”
[01:04.63]As I soon learnt, he was English himself! | 我很快就知道，他自己就是个英国人！
